---
import ProjectLayout from '../../../layouts/ProjectLayout.astro';
import HeroImage from '../../../assets/writing/hero-any-one-will-do.png';
---

<ProjectLayout
	title="Any One Will Do"
	tagline="Randomly pick who goes next, or split a group into balanced teams."
	heroImage={HeroImage}
	liveUrl="https://anyonewilldo.com"
	liveLabel="Try it"
	writingHref="/writing/any-one-will-do/"
>
	<p>A privacy-first randomizer with a clean UI and smooth, satisfying animations — no ads, no accounts, no tracking, no upsells.</p>
	<p>Features include auto-saved sessions, import/export, weighted entries, shared results, grouping, and support for adding metadata (like links) to entries.</p>
	<p>See the <a href="/writing/30-day-launch-check-in/">30-day launch check-in</a> for how it's done since launch.</p>
</ProjectLayout>
